      "created_at": "2012-12-04T16:48:34.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I introduced the game to 3 other people last night and had quite an entertaining game.&nbsp; It was Bunker, Unity, Tempest and Fanatic vs Omnitron at the Pike Industrial Complex.</p><p>It was a very entertaining game.&nbsp; At one point we had 4 escaped lab rats and an experimental mutagen in play.&nbsp; We were a little worried until Omnitron terraformed them, and then we were a lot worried!</p><p>We kept at it and the game was pretty close at the end.&nbsp; Bunker, Unity and Tempest were all incapacitated.&nbsp; Fanatic was down to 6 HP's when her turn finished and Omnitron was at 1 HP.</p><p>We flipped over the supercooled trisolvent vat which ended up finishing off Omnitron.&nbsp; It felt like the end of Terminator 2 when he got melted down. &nbsp; It seemed like it would be a good Story Challenge, when the Rook City ones are written.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Very fun session and 3 more fans!</p>",
